factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Caption says the complaint was filed 'அமாணி கிராமத்தின் காத்தவராயன்' and that the sewage is in Kallangattuvalasu, which mixes two places; the article says Amani village for the farmland issue and Kallangattuvalasu for the sewage, but the caption presents Kallangattuvalasu as the location where Kathavarayan's complaint was made, which is not stated.
  Reel_script says the sewage is discharged in 'அமாணி கிராமத்தில்... கல்லாங்காட்டுவலசு பகுதியில்' combining two locations into one sentence; the article places the sewage in Kallangattuvalasu area, not explicitly in Amani village.
  Slide 1 says 'குமாரபாளையம் அருகே அமாணி கிராமம் பகுதி' as the location of the sewage problem, which conflates Amani village with the sewage location (Kallangattuvalasu) and is not stated in the article.
  Caption describes the sewage canal as 'வாய்க்காலில்' and the headline/slide says 'கழிவுநீர் கலப்பு' without the detail that it is canal water; minor, but the reel_script's 'கழிவுநீர் கலப்பதைத் தடுக்க' is accurate. (Not a problem on its own.)
  Caption states the 'நாள்: நேற்று' (yesterday) for the meeting date, which the article supports ('நேற்று நடந்தது'), so no issue here; however the reel_script omits the key result that the Kathavarayan complaint was about farmland turned barren by a village administrative officer, which is partially covered but the caption adds 'நடவடிக்கை' as an action by 'கலெக்டர் மற்றும் மாவட்ட அதிகாரிகள்', which is accurate.
